        <h3>About the author</h3>
        <p><p><strong>Cynthia Tyler</strong> is the published author of two novels, <em>Descanso</em> (Haworth Press, 2005) and <em>Shadow Work</em> (Haworth Press, 2006). Her website is <a href="http://www.cynthiatyler.com">www.cynthiatyler.com</a>. A lifelong Dodger fan, she lives in Pasadena, California.</p>
</p>
